rg/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> \"5\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .\n_:l11 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:l12 .\n_:l12 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> \"5\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .\n_:l12 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:l13 .\n_:l13 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> \"5\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .\n_:l13 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:l14 .\n_:l14 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> \"5\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .\n_:l14 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .\n"
